    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 2. Radioactive Decay — Recovering Half-Life [S+N]\n\nThe decay law $N(t) = N_0 e^{-\\lambda t}$ is exact. Given count data, recover the decay constant $\\lambda$ (and hence half-life $t_{1/2} = \\ln 2 / \\lambda$). Here we derive the gradient analytically.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "/* Symbolic decay model and gradient */\nN_model(lam, N0, t_i) := N0 * exp(-lam * t_i)$\nL_decay(lam, N0, t_i, y_i) := (1/2) * (y_i - N_model(lam, N0, t_i))^2$\ndL_dlam : diff(L_decay(lam, N0, t[i], y[i]), lam);\ndL_dN0 : diff(L_decay(lam, N0, t[i], y[i]), N0);",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 10,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "%e^-(t[i]*lam)*N0*t[i]*(y[i]-%e^-(t[i]*lam)*N0)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "data": {
            "text/latex": [
              "-\\left(e^ {- \\left(t_{i}\\,{\\it lam}\\right) }\\,\\left(y_{i}-e^ {- \\left(t_{i} \\,{\\it lam}\\right) }\\,N_{0}\\right)\\right)"
            ]
          },
          "execution_count": 10,
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "execute_result"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "/* True: lambda=0.1, N0=1000 */\nn_decay : 30$\nt_decay : np_linspace(0, 20, n_decay)$\nN_true : np_scale(1000.0, np_exp(np_scale(-0.1, t_decay)))$\nN_noisy : np_add(N_true, np_scale(30.0, np_randn([n_decay])))$\n\n/* Cost and analytic gradient */\ndecay_cost(p) := block([lam_v, N0_v, pred, res],\n  lam_v : np_ref(p, 0), N0_v : np_ref(p, 1),\n  pred : np_scale(N0_v, np_exp(np_scale(-lam_v, t_decay))),\n  res : np_sub(pred, N_noisy),\n  np_sum(np_pow(res, 2)) / (2 * n_decay))$\n\ndecay_grad(p) := block([lam_v, N0_v, e_lt, pred, res],\n  lam_v : np_ref(p, 0), N0_v : np_ref(p, 1),\n  e_lt : np_exp(np_scale(-lam_v, t_decay)),\n  pred : np_scale(N0_v, e_lt),\n  res : np_sub(pred, N_noisy),\n  ndarray([\n    -np_sum(np_mul(np_mul(res, np_scale(N0_v, t_decay)), e_lt)) / n_decay,\n    np_sum(np_mul(res, e_lt)) / n_decay\n  ]))$\n\n[p_decay, _, _] : np_minimize(decay_cost, decay_grad, ndarray([0.5, 500.0]))$\nlam_rec : np_ref(p_decay, 0)$\nN0_rec : np_ref(p_decay, 1)$\nprint(\"Recovered: lambda =\", lam_rec, \", N0 =\", N0_rec)$\nprint(\"Half-life:\", float(log(2) / lam_rec), \"  (true:\", float(log(2) / 0.1), \")\")$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 11,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Recovered: lambda = 0.10067102172673245 , N0 = 1020.3564110496006\nHalf-life: 6.8852701469690665   (true: 6.931471805599453 )"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "ax_draw2d(\n  color=\"red\", marker_size=5, name=\"Noisy counts\",\n  points(np_to_list(t_decay), np_to_list(N_noisy)),\n  color=\"blue\", line_width=2, name=\"Recovered fit\",\n  explicit(N0_rec * exp(-lam_rec * t), t, 0, 20),\n  color=\"gray\", dash=\"dash\", name=\"True decay\",\n  explicit(1000 * exp(-0.1 * t), t, 0, 20),\n  title=\"Radioactive Decay: Parameter Recovery\",\n  xlabel=\"Time\", ylabel=\"Count N(t)\",\n  grid=true, showlegend=true\n)$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 12,
      "outputs": [
